  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "WOCE P14N - July/ August 1993 CTD and Bottle Data Report",
  "description": "High resolution, top to bottom observations in the central Aleutians (Baron's of Standard) by deoprophic (T,S,O) and hydrochemical (O2, PO4, NO3, SiO4) categories. Line goes from 59° N 174° W to 50° N 179° E and then to Fiji. 18 stations are inside the Bering Sea.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Part of the World Ocean Circulation Experiment (WOCE) to observe (top to bottom) in Aleutians (Baron's of Standard) by deoprophic (T,S,O) and hydrochemical (O2, PO4, NO3, SiO4) categories.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23519257",
